     "titulo": "Animate and inanimate masculine",
     "texto": [
      "In the masculine singular, an animate object usually takes the genitive form: **widzę nowego sąsiada**. An inanimate object usually keeps the nominative form: **widzę nowy stolik**.",
      "The adjective's ending goes with the noun. Notice whether the noun refers to a person or a thing."
     ],
